{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":802,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900635,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1437120672,"LastPoster":{"Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1900635,"PostDate":1437120672,"PostContent":"We are getting married in October 2016 and I although most things are sorted one of the areas I a...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seemnoty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.51.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437115554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dahead","Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.126.222.149","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39e4e107b36c5b983d23f0a3f60d4e89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in October 2016 and I although most things are sorted one of the areas I am really struggling to find are decent bridesmaid dresses for \u00a3100 or under per dress. The colours I am looking for are burnt orange and royal blue - naturally royal blue is easy to find but burnt orange is rather more difficult.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have found lots of websites which offer a service where you can buy a dress custom made - looking like they come from China. I used to live in Hong Kong and so have had things made in China before and the quality is very good. I am worried though that if I go with one of these companies I will be parting with a lot of money but not getting anything or getting rubbish quality products.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One of the websites I&#039;ve found is: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone used this place or any other internet custom making service?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900635,"PostDate":1437120672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are getting married in October 2016 and I although most things are sorted one of the areas I am really struggling to find are decent bridesmaid dresses for \u00a3100 or under per dress. The colours I am looking for are burnt orange and royal blue - naturally royal blue is easy to find but burnt orange is rather more difficult.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have found lots of websites which offer a service where you can buy a dress custom made - looking like they come from China. I used to live in Hong Kong and so have had things made in China before and the quality is very good. I am worried though that if I go with one of these companies I will be parting with a lot of money but not getting anything or getting rubbish quality products.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One of the websites I've found is: <a href='http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone used this place or any other internet custom making service?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seemnoty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.51.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437115554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dahead","Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.201.32.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1a18bcfb7c7c6d0caf709fd5654d4de","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"dahead\"], I&#039;d been having the same problem, (I&#039;m from the UK) and have been trying to find dresses that will fit all in my bridal party for a decent price. I was planning on getting dresses from China but then came across &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/&lt;\/a&gt; depending on how many dresses you have, a lot come in under \u00a3100 and they always seem to have sale! The great part for me is that they make custom dresses\/plus size\/maternity\/jr. Bridesmaid versions and even flower girl versions of the adult dress if you need it. They have plenty of colours to choose from. If you see a dress you like elsewhere, they are happy to quote you. It&#039;s the easiest option for me. I also love that they have a \"showroom\" section where you can add dresses that you love and then invite your bridesmaids who can comment on dresses and add ones they like....great way to narrow down options. Check out the real weddings page and you can see loads and loads of photos from brides who have sent photos of their bridesmaids, I haven&#039;t ordered mine yet but the quality does look good.\n\n\nI hope this helps. If you d happen to find any other good websites, please let me know [emoji4]","Attachments":[],"Id":1902179,"PostDate":1439133957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284000-dahead\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dahead<\/span><\/a>, I'd been having the same problem, (I'm from the UK) and have been trying to find dresses that will fit all in my bridal party for a decent price. I was planning on getting dresses from China but then came across <a href='http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/<\/a> depending on how many dresses you have, a lot come in under \u00a3100 and they always seem to have sale! The great part for me is that they make custom dresses\/plus size\/maternity\/jr. Bridesmaid versions and even flower girl versions of the adult dress if you need it. They have plenty of colours to choose from. If you see a dress you like elsewhere, they are happy to quote you. It's the easiest option for me. I also love that they have a \"showroom\" section where you can add dresses that you love and then invite your bridesmaids who can comment on dresses and add ones they like....great way to narrow down options. Check out the real weddings page and you can see loads and loads of photos from brides who have sent photos of their bridesmaids, I haven't ordered mine yet but the quality does look good.<br><br>\nI hope this helps. If you d happen to find any other good websites, please let me know [emoji4] \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420514404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.126.178.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by dahead, 14 October 2015 - 07:58 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1444881499,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7810f8a517aeedaaed260267a6dc8b87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SunshineDreamKay\"] Thank for your suggestion :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906280,"PostDate":1444881432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281615\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281615-sunshinedreamkay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SunshineDreamKay<\/span><\/a> Thank for your suggestion <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seemnoty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.51.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437115554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dahead","Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79404","Title":"Who U Guys Know The Website","LastPostDate":1444881432},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
